"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"PRP-TCM Therapy - Platelet-Rich Plasma Combined with TCM\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-teal-900 to-slate-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/40\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold mb-6\">PRP-TCM Joint Regeneration Therapy</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-teal-200 mb-4\">International Medical Care</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">East-West Integration · Root &amp; Symptom Treatment · Zero Wait · Safe &amp; Compliant</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-teal-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-600 transition-colors\">Consult Now</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">Learn More</button></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"w-6 h-10 border-2 border-white/50 rounded-full flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-3 bg-white rounded-full mt-2\" style=\"transform: translateY(1.60281px);\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">What is PRP-TCM Joint Regeneration Therapy?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma) TCM Joint Regeneration Therapy is an innovative treatment combining modern regenerative medicine with traditional Chinese medicine wisdom.</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">By extracting high-concentration platelet plasma from the patient's own blood, combined with traditional TCM therapies such as acupuncture, herbal steaming, and massage, it achieves the triple goals of cartilage repair, inflammation reduction, and functional recovery.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-teal-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle \"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">Internationally Certified · Safe &amp; Effective</span></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"PRP Treatment\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"advantages\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Core Advantages</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Four core advantages protecting your joint health</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">East-West Integration, Enhanced Efficacy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">PRP promotes cartilage repair and anti-inflammatory effects through high-concentration growth factors, while TCM unblocks meridians and harmonizes qi-blood through acupuncture and herbal medicine. Clinical data shows that PRP combined with warm needle acupuncture significantly improves joint function recovery indicators, with cartilage defect repair speed increased by 2.1 times compared to PRP alone.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Complete Solution Addressing Root &amp; Symptoms</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Not only resolves joint pain symptoms but also improves constitution through holistic TCM conditioning, fundamentally delaying joint degeneration for long-term stable efficacy.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Zero Waiting Time</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">No need to wait months; from consultation to treatment completion typically takes only 1-2 weeks.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Safe &amp; Compliant</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">PRP therapy is widely used in Chinese hospitals at all levels and clinical research, with national-level guidelines regulating TCM treatments.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"indications\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Indications</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">The following conditions are suitable for PRP-TCM therapy</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757175-5700dde675bc?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Early to Mid-Stage Knee Osteoarthritis\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Early to Mid-Stage Knee Osteoarthritis</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Kellgren-Lawrence Grade I-III</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Joint pain, morning stiffness, limited mobility</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Poor response or intolerance to oral analgesics/sodium hyaluronate injections</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Desire to preserve natural joints, delay or avoid joint replacement</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Mild to Moderate Cartilage Wear\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Mild to Moderate Cartilage Wear</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">MRI Shows Thinning, Focal Defects</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Cartilage thinning, focal defects</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Not yet full-thickness large-scale loss</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Suitable for PRP repair therapy</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019614242-c5c5dee9f50b?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Chronic Sports Injury-Related Joint Disease\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Chronic Sports Injury-Related Joint Disease</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Long-term Exercise-Induced Joint Issues</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Ligament injuries</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Cartilage wear with joint pain</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Athlete joint protection</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581056771107-24ca5f4d9b6d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Post-Arthroscopy/Microfracture Rehabilitation\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Post-Arthroscopy/Microfracture Rehabilitation</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Combined PRP + TCM Post-Surgery</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Effectively promotes cartilage repair</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Reduces post-operative stiffness</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Accelerates rehabilitation process</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505751172876-fa1923c5c528?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Intolerance to Western Medicine or Safety Concerns\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Intolerance to Western Medicine or Safety Concerns</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Seeking Holistic TCM Conditioning</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Reduce dependence on NSAIDs</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Holistic TCM conditioning plan</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Personalized treatment approach</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"treatment\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Treatment Content</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Three treatment modules for comprehensive joint rehabilitation</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Module 1: Core PRP Treatment</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600\">Platelet-Rich Plasma Therapy</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">1</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Venous Blood Draw</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">20-50ml blood collection</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">2</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">High-Speed Centrifugation</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Platelet concentration 3-5x normal</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">3</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Ultrasound-Guided Injection</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Precise intra-articular injection</p></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">Typically 2-4 injections per course, spaced 2-4 weeks apart, customized by physician</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf \"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Module 2: TCM Synergistic Treatment</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600\">Traditional Chinese Medicine</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Acupuncture</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Immediate pain relief, meridian unblocking</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Herbal Medicine</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Holistic conditioning, qi-blood harmonization</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Herbal Steaming</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Local penetration, warming meridians</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Tui Na Massage</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Joint lubrication, adhesion release</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Moxibustion</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Warming circulation, blood stasis resolution</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">Module 3: Functional Exercise &amp; Rehab Guidance</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600\">Rehabilitation &amp; Exercise</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Muscle Strength Training</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Quadriceps isometric contraction exercises to strengthen knee stability</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Traditional Exercises</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Baduanjin, Tai Chi recommended for long-term joint maintenance</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Treatment Process</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Eight-step complete process, accompanying you from consultation to recovery</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">1</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Online Consultation &amp; Medical Record Review</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Submit weight-bearing knee X-rays, MRI images, treatment history and related reports for medical advisor review and preliminary indication screening</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">2</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Remote Consultation &amp; Plan Confirmation</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Joint video consultation with orthopedic, rehabilitation and TCM physicians to determine treatment plan, cost estimate and schedule, providing bilingual treatment plan</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">3</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Medical Visa &amp; Travel Arrangements</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Issue medical invitation letter, guide S2/S1 medical visa application, assist with flight booking, airport transfer and accommodation near hospital</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">4</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Pre-Admission Comprehensive Assessment</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Complete required tests: blood count, coagulation, infectious disease screening, lipids, platelet count, ECG, TCM constitution identification and knee imaging review</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">5</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">PRP Treatment Implementation</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Ultrasound-guided precise intra-articular PRP injection, completed as outpatient (approx. 45-60 min), observe for 1 hour before normal activity</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">6</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">TCM Synergistic Treatment</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Acupuncture on PRP injection day to promote even distribution, 2-3 sessions/week between injections, daily herbal steaming, massage and moxibustion to consolidate results</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">7</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Post-Treatment Rehab Guidance &amp; Discharge</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Rehabilitation physician creates personalized exercise plan, arrange mail-order herbal pills/pastes for patients needing long-term TCM conditioning</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">8</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Remote Follow-up &amp; Health Management</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Mobile pain scoring and joint function self-assessment system, remote video follow-ups, MRI comparison analysis as needed to evaluate cartilage repair progress</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"efficacy\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Efficacy Data</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Clinical studies confirm significant efficacy of PRP combined with TCM</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">181</div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Patients in Clinical Study</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">2.1x</div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">Cartilage Repair Speed Increase</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">Significant</div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">WOMAC/VAS Score Improvement</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"cases\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Real Cases</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Real patient feedback, witnessing efficacy</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546519638-68e109498ffc?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Three Transoceanic Flights Back to China for PRP\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Three Transoceanic Flights Back to China for PRP</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Professional Athlete Returns to Court</p><p class=\"text-gray-600\">American professional basketball player Dwayne suffered unbearable right knee pain after a tournament in Shenzhen. Doctors precisely diagnosed patellar ligament injury, medial retinaculum injury, and cartilage wear through musculoskeletal ultrasound. After three PRP treatments, Dwayne's right knee pain was basically relieved, allowing him to return to his beloved basketball career.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Real Results from 181 Patients – Significant Gait Improvement\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">Real Results from 181 Patients – Significant Gait Improvement</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Clinical Research Data</p><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Clinical study of 181 knee osteoarthritis patients confirmed: patients treated with warm needle acupuncture combined with PRP injection showed significantly better gait frequency, speed, stride length and joint support phase ratio compared to PRP-only group; WOMAC and VAS scores significantly decreased, HSS joint scores significantly increased, with no significant increase in adverse event rates.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Support Services</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Thoughtful services throughout for worry-free medical care</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Visa Guidance &amp; Processing</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Professional team assists with medical visa</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Arrival Reception &amp; Transport</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Airport pickup and full transportation arrangement</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users \"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Language Support &amp; Translation</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Professional medical translators throughout</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">Escort &amp; Medical Coordination</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Dedicated coordinator for visit process</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">International Medical Documents</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Medical report translation and document processing</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Pricing</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Transparent pricing, no hidden fees</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Basic Package</h3>